# Where the in-app Feedback button sends reports. Unset, the button does not
# appear - an address written into the markup is an address that gets scraped,
# so this is opt-in per environment.
#
# Local: copy this file to .env. Vercel: add it under Project Settings ->
# Environment Variables. The PUBLIC_ prefix is required for Astro to expose it
# to the browser.
#
# On Vercel, add it as an ordinary variable. It is read at request time as well
# as at build time (see src/lib/feedback-email.ts), so either reaches the page -
# but a variable the build cannot see used to remove the button from the whole
# site in silence, which is worth not repeating.
PUBLIC_FEEDBACK_EMAIL=
